    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n42634" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sardŏnyx</span></b> ,
		ychis, m. and f., =
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σαρδόνυξ</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a precious stone</i>, <i>sardonyx; fem.</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 37, 6,
				23, § 85</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Pers. 1,
			16</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 7, 144</span></i>. —<i>Masc.</i>, <i><span class="en">Juv. 6, 382</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 4,
				28, 4</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 61,
			6</span></i>. —<i>Gen. plur.</i> sardonychum,
				<i><span class="en">Juv.
				13, 139</span></i>.— Hence,
			adj.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sardŏnĭchus</span></b> , a, um,
				<i>of sardonyx</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lapis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. Job, 28, 16</span></i>
			.</div>
